" in 2015, Angelina Jolie, Gwyneth Paltrow, and Reese Witherspoon were among the actress who sent tapes or auditioned for the part of Cher Horowitz.\n\nThe iconic role was later given to Alicia Silverstone.\n\nFreddie Prinze Jr. almost played Spider-Man in the early-200"
